    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48600,48840,48944,49064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うっはー！　この指輪すっげーな！
炎が打てるなんてさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoaaa! This ring's awesome! Can't
believe it can really shoot flames.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！　クルクルール！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru! Coulucouleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;！　そんなむやみに打ったら、
周りのもの、燃えちゃうでしょ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;! Don't just shoot at random!
You might start a fire!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだよ。それに人に向けちゃダメだからね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's right. And it'd be really
bad if you hit someone with it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかってるって、全然だいじょーぶ！
燃えるもんなんて、そうそうないしさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I get it, I get it. It's perfectly fine! There's
nothing flammable around here, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほ、炎……簡単に、も、燃えてしまうだ……。
おら、高級素材だから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>F-Flames... I-I'd, b-burn pretty easily...
I'm made of...real fine materials, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルトさんが怖がってるじゃない！
必要のない時は打たないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Look, you're scaring Albert! Don't
shoot it unless we really need to.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48844</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>燃える……、燃えるだ……
真っ赤になって、パチパチ火の粉上げて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Burn... I'll burn... I'll light up, bright red...crackle
a bit, and then...there'll be nothin' left but ashes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>しまいにゃ、真っ黒になって、
消し炭のように……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ashes, cinders...
B-Burnt...black as coal...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いやーーーー！　怖い！　炎、怖い、
おら、燃えたくねぇだーー！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaaaaaahhhhh! It's terrifyin'! Fire's terrifyin',
ya understand!? I don't wanna buuuurn!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_012_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ア、アルベルトさん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-Albert?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
